efund requests"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["For the first payment of a new office subscription, the customer may request a refund within 7 calendar days if Word Count Tool cannot be installed or activated on a compatible system and RoutineOff support has not been able to resolve the issue. The request must be sent to ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:info@routineoff.com","children":"info@routineoff.com"}]," with the office name, receipt or invoice number, device requirements, and a description of the problem. RoutineOff will normally confirm the decision within 5 business days. Approved refunds are submitted to Stripe within 10 business days after approval; the customer's bank may require additional time to post the funds. This policy does not limit mandatory consumer rights."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Requests that are normally not refundable"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Renewal periods already made available, unused time after cancellation, unsupported devices, missing required Microsoft Office components, or results affected by poor-quality documents are not normally refundable when the software and account operated as described. RoutineOff will still review duplicate charges, service failures, and rights provided by applicable law."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Digital delivery"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Word Count Tool is a digital software product. After Stripe confirms payment, customers receive the official download link and tool account credentials at the business email used for checkout. Delivery normally occurs within five minutes. If delivery has not arrived within 30 minutes, contact support and do not place a second order. No physical goods are shipped."}]]}],"$L8"]}],"$L9"]}]]
8:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Failed or expired subscriptions"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"If renewal fails, the service normally provides a grace period of up to 3 calendar days before tool access is paused. Stripe may retry payment during this period. Restoring payment will reactivate the existing authorised users where possible."}]]}]
